    n ^ 2 + 8 * n + 1) * m₀ ^ 2)) (hq : n ^ 4 * (2 * n + 1) ^ 8 * q = 4 * (8 * n ^ 2 + 4 * n + 1) *
    (12 * n ^ 2 + 4 * n + 1) * (-4352 * n ^ 10 - 2944 * n ^ 9 - 1088 * n ^ 8 - 352 * n ^ 7 - 144 *
